## 🛠️ Recreation Commands

### To recreate the best model (S_Ultimate / EXP-017):
```powershell
conda activate trader
python agent/experiment_runner.py --experiment S_Ultimate
```

### To run a Threshold Sweep on the best model:
```powershell
conda activate trader
python agent/threshold_sweep.py
```

### To run the Backtester on vault predictions:
```powershell
conda activate trader
python agent/backtester.py --threshold 0.50
```

### To run Optuna Hyperparameter Search:
```powershell
conda activate trader
python agent/optuna_search.py --n-trials 30
```

